! CAM-B3LYP def2-TZVPD AutoAux RIJCOSX TightSCF
# Item 8: QM-region sensitivity of the near-field correction TDC/PDA.
# GAS PHASE, matching the condition of the reviewer's own Q-Chem calculation
# (and avoiding the double-counting that would arise if CB/HB2/HB3 became QM
# while still carrying MM point charges).
# 44 = CR2(29) + Tyr202 phenol(12) + 3 link H, cut at CG-CB.
# 47 = the same, cut one bond further out at CB-CA, retaining CB + 2 HB.
# Same functional/basis/TDA setting as the gauge-verified dipole_gauge run.
%maxcore 3000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%tddft
  NRoots 5
  TDA false
end
* xyzfile -1 1 geom_47.xyz
